# Two files, one identity. A stale copy left behind, or an artifact unpacked twice -
# merging them would double every axiom while looking like it worked, so loading fails.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix ex:  <http://example.org/same/> .

<http://example.org/same/> a owl:Ontology .
ex:X a owl:Class .
